# ScriptPlayerActor: Temple Grounds 01_temple_hive03_dark (3bfa3eff) layer 2: e001b013d "Samus" (flags
# 0x104: 0x100 = gun drawn before the suit, 0x4). With the grapple beam the cinematic grapple model loads
# (UpdateGrappleModel, PumpGrappleModel, RenderGrapple); taking it back drops the grapple models.
@f260 layer 2
@f300 god 1; give grappleBeam 1
@f320 obj e001b013d
@f340 send e001b013d Activate
@f700 obj e001b013d
@f720 send e001b013d Increment
@f900 take grappleBeam
@f1000 send e001b013d Deactivate
@f1300 send e001b013d Delete
